            <sparkle:version>2.1.3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Calibrated scale-bar exports</h2>
<ul>
<li>Scale bar + SVG embeds a lossless PNG with an editable vector bar and label.</li>
<li>Scale bar + JPEG saves the selected image with a high-quality calibrated bar.</li>
<li>Both follow the region, channels, LUT, frame and export scale.</li>
</ul>
<p>macOS Apple silicon. Physical comparison linking is planned for 2.1.4.</p>
]]></description>
