        <item>
            <title>2.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:48:27 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2.1.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>LUT range and live contrast</h2>
<ul>
<li>Full intensity range by default, with optional Auto-fit.</li>
<li>Scroll to zoom, drag or scroll sideways to pan, and double-click for the full range.</li>
<li>Live contrast updates while dragging, plus exact Min/Max entry.</li>
</ul>
<p>macOS Apple silicon. Existing slides, annotations and viewing caches are preserved.</p>
]]></description>
